WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.977
Welcome to Module 9 Data Cleaning in PostgreSQL This
module

00:00:06.003 --> 00:00:11.056
brings together the ideas from earlier modules and
turns them into a repeatable cleaning workflow

00:00:12.783 --> 00:00:18.941
We will profile missing and invalid values
standardize representation validate business rules
identify

00:00:18.954 --> 00:00:24.467
duplicate groups quarantine questionable records
preview updates safely and add constraints when the

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:30.050
rules are known The most important principle is
simple cleaning should make

00:00:30.076 --> 00:00:32.010
uncertainty visible not hide it
